WEBVTT

00:00:27.160 --> 00:00:28.340
Iden: You wished to see me, sir?

00:00:28.680 --> 00:00:29.200
Garrick: Approach.

00:00:35.440 --> 00:00:36.700
Garrick: The Emperor is dead.

00:00:41.100 --> 00:00:42.310
Iden: So what happens now?

00:00:42.460 --> 00:00:57.500
Garrick: We retaliate, Commander. The Empire will assault the very foundation of the Rebels’ pathetic belief in themselves. Tell me, Iden. What is the source of their belief?

00:00:58.410 --> 00:00:58.980
Iden: Hope.

00:00:59.880 --> 00:01:00.420
Garrick: Correct.

00:01:01.840 --> 00:01:06.280
Garrick: This Messenger’s presence is a great honor. One I choose to share with my daughter.

00:01:16.320 --> 00:01:49.620
Palpatine: Admiral Versio. Operation: Cinder is to begin at once. Resistance. Rebellion. Defiance. These are concepts that cannot be allowed to persist. You are but one of many tools by which these ideas shall be burned away. Heed my Messenger. He shall relay you to your target.

00:01:52.610 --> 00:02:03.310
Garrick: Operation: Cinder is the last command of our Emperor, and the first step in securing our future. Inferno is crucial to its success.

00:02:03.540 --> 00:02:04.820
Iden: What's our target, sir?

00:02:05.220 --> 00:02:06.730
Messenger: You are not verified.

00:02:09.970 --> 00:02:16.250
Garrick: That information can wait. For now, here are your next assignments.

00:02:16.250 --> 00:02:27.580
Garrick: They are unusual. But these are unusual times. Go, Commander. Do what you do best.
